 ited\nTime: 10 AM – 2 PM\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/ev
 ents/199496\n\nHave a love for the game\, the strategy\, and the social ri
 tual of Mahjong? Join us in Bondo for an open play afternoon designed for 
