 on over lunch at Café Q or Lunasol. The perfect way to turn a few games i
 nto an afternoon of conversation and connection.\n\n*This event is complim
 entary and reserved for members only. Mahjong mats\, tiles\, shufflers\, a
 nd racks will be provided\; however\, members are encouraged to bring thei
 r own current National Mah Jongg League scorecard. We kindly ask that all 
