 rompts designed to spark connection and keep dialogue flowing. Enjoy a tab
 le of pastries\, fresh fruit\, and parfaits to begin\, followed by your ch
 oice of entrée and generous sides\, with Bloody Marys and mimosas availab
 le throughout.\n\nWhether you’re looking to expand your social circle\, 
