 The afternoon will begin with professional instructors Johny Mario\, Balle
 rs Head Pickleball Pro\, and Leo Justus\, General Manager and Padel Pro\, 
 giving members guidance before moving into rotating play and friendly matc
 hes across both sports\, guided by the Ballers team. Members will have the
  opportunity to rotate between pickleball and padel courts to experience b
 oth racquet sports with pros and members. Post play\, members can stick ar
 ound to mix\, mingle\, and enjoy food and drinks for purchase at the Balle
